      "pageKind": "pdf",
      "zh": [
        "我要感谢 Richard Birkett 于2018年发起伦敦当代艺术学院与 CRMEP 之间重启的合作，这次合作促成了本书所源自的会议；也要感谢 ICA 策展人 Nydia Swaby 与 Sara Sassanelli，她们接手此事，并以如此从容的态度将其推进至完成。"
      ],
      "en": [
        "I would like to thank Richard Birkett for initiating the renewed collaboration between the ICA London and CRMEP in 2018, which led to the conference from which this book derives; and the ICA curators Nydia Swaby and Sara Sassanelli, for taking it on and seeing it through to completion with such equanimity."
      ],
